  "details": "- CVE-2026-27651: fix null pointer dereference in ngx_mail_auth_http_module\n  when clearing the password in auth http requests with CRAM-MD5/APOP\n- CVE-2026-27654: fix heap buffer overflow in ngx_http_dav_module when a\n  COPY/MOVE destination URI is shorter than the location alias\n- CVE-2026-27654: also require the COPY/MOVE Destination to match the aliased\n  location prefix, and tighten ngx_http_map_uri_to_path() accordingly\n- CVE-2026-27784: fix integer overflow in ngx_http_mp4_module atom entry\n  count validation on 32-bit platforms",
